= Arkady Kremer

Arkady Kremer is a leader of the General Jewish Labour Bund, the federation of Jewish socialists.

- @white_collar
- @union_unity
- @welfare
- @moderate_economic_plan
- @root: Return to main

@white_collar
title: Organizing white-collar workers
subtitle: Improve our standing among the new middle class.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; new_middle_rsdrp += 6*(1-dissent);

We have increased our organizing among white-collar workers.

@union_unity
title: Union-party coordination
subtitle: Reduce dissent among the unions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_dissent -= 10;

We have reduced tensions with the Labor faction.

welfare
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_rsdrp += 5*(1 - dissent); advisor_action_timer = 6;

Kremer has directed the Bund to send funding to welfare organizations. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@moderate_economic_plan
title: Support the reformist economic plan
